  The numbering plans of nodes/FormatTemplate/transforms/phone/numberingPlans.ts and the
  example numbers of nodes/FormatTemplate/__tests__/fixtures/phone/examples.json are
  generated from resources/PhoneNumberMetadata.xml of libphonenumber, at the version
  pinned in nodes/FormatTemplate/scripts/gen_phone_plans.js. They are a modified form of
  that file: comments, examples and per-type patterns are dropped, the national prefix
  rules are applied to the formats, the non-geographic entities are left out, and the
  plans of FR, US and CA keep the behaviour of the node's first typeVersion 6 release.
